ked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"This was an issue reported by https://github.com/ananyaks here https://github.com/YugaByte/yugabyte-db/pull/429#issuecomment-412404377.\r\n\r\nConsider the following example with a compound primary key consisting of 3 columns -- one partition column and two clustering column. [Note: Simpler compound primary keys, with say just two columns do not have this bug.]\r\n\r\n```\r\nCREATE KEYSPACE IF NOT EXISTS k;\r\nUSE k;\r\n\r\nDROP TABLE T;\r\nCREATE TABLE T (k text, t1 int, t2 int, v text, PRIMARY KEY (k, t1, t2));\r\n\r\nINSERT INTO T (k, t1, t2, v) VALUES ('key1', 1, 1, 'v');\r\nINSERT INTO T (k, t1, t2, v) VALUES ('key1', 1, 2, 'v');\r\nINSERT INTO T (k, t1, t2, v) VALUES ('key1', 2, 1, 'v');\r\nINSERT INTO T (k, t1, t2, v) VALUES ('key1', 2, 2, 'v');\r\n\r\nINSERT INTO T (k, t1, t2, v) VALUES ('key2', 1, 1, 'v');\r\nINSERT INTO T (k, t1, t2, v) VALUES ('key2', 1, 2, 'v');\r\nINSERT INTO T (k, t1, t2, v) VALUES ('key2', 2, 1, 'v');\r\nINSERT INTO T (k, t1, t2, v) VALUES ('key2', 2, 2, 'v');\r\n```\r\n\r\nNow,\r\n```\r\nDELETE FROM T WHERE k = 'key1' and t1=1;\r\n```\r\nshould only delete 2 of the above rows. But all 4 of the rows for 'key1' seem to be getting deleted.\r\n\r\n```\r\ncqlsh:k> SELECT * FROM T;\r\n\r\n k    | t1 | t2 | v\r\n------+----+----+---\r\n key2 |  1 |  1 | v\r\n key2 |  1 |  2 | v\r\n key2 |  2 |  1 | v\r\n key2 |  2 |  2 | v\r\n```","closed_by":{"login":"yugabyte-ci","id":17281578,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MjgxNTc4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17281578?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yugabyte-ci","html_url":"https://github.com/yugabyte-ci","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yugabyte-ci/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yugabyte-ci/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yugabyte-ci/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yugabyte-ci/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yugabyte-ci/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yugabyte-ci/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yugabyte-ci/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yugabyte-ci/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yugabyte-ci/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/434/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/434/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}